VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'I personally have a plan to escape the so-called&nbsp; permanent underclass and help my fellow creatives&nbsp;&nbsp; at the same time to do the same thing. This&nbsp; includes using Claude Code, Fable 5, and of&nbsp;&nbsp; course, fal. So, my project is called Workman&nbsp; Labs, named after me, Matt Workman. And right now,&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'it\'s basically a Gen Media jobs tracker. And I\'m&nbsp; going to be keeping this large growing database&nbsp;&nbsp; of Gen Media jobs and key articles and insights&nbsp; that I\'m feeding into Claude so that we can track&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'insights over time to learn about the generative&nbsp; media industry and to help people find jobs within&nbsp;&nbsp; it. And in other news, Fable 5 has been released&nbsp; to the general public and I used it this week to&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'implement my first gen media feature to Workman&nbsp; Labs. Now, whenever I add a new job to the board,&nbsp;&nbsp; it\'s going to generate a custom graphic that works&nbsp; with my brand and the context of the particular&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[00:49] [scene:talk]
